  "width 2 encodes 00 GPIO / 01 alt 2 / 10 alt 1 / 11 primary, width 1 encodes 0 GPIO / 1 primary.",
  "verified: false = the layout isn't settled (hardware-tasks 14): the HAL leaves such pads' mux alone.",
  "reserved: a settled field GPIO never takes (the pad carries a boot function); drivers may still select it.",
